	(text "Program BLDO1 = 3.3V before enabling PG / PH outputs.\nVBAT is filtered +3V3; VDD_IO is the separately sequenced VCC_PG.\nModule TX/RTS -> SoC RX/CTS; module RX/CTS <- SoC TX/RTS.\nX32KFOUT is open drain; R715 pulls it up to VCC_PG."
